  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "みんな熱いじゃねえか。\n本番がますます楽しみになってきたぜ！！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天ヶ瀬 冬馬"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（皆さんのお話を聞いていると、\nこちらまで胸が熱くなる。これが……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（315プロのアイドルが持つ、輝きと力なんだ）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……ねぇ、何一人でじーんとしてんの？\n自分は部外者、なんて思ってない？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだぜ。俺たちがここに集まった、\nその始まりはあんたなんだからな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……つーか、こんな風に話す時間があったなら、\nアレ、入れとかなきゃよかったぜ……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "アレ？　何のことですか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや、あとで携帯見といてくれ！\n留守電に決意、込めといたからさ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサー。分かってると思うけど、\n俺たちなら絶対にステージを成功させられるよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だって、俺には仲間がいる。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それも、大勢の仲間が。……アンタが連れて\nきてくれたこの事務所で、それが分かったから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……そろそろ時間だな。\nみんな、行くぞ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もしもしプロデューサー。今日はお互いJIFの準備\nで話す時間がそうないだろうし、留守電に残すぜ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-31:text",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今日までありがとう！　……って、いきなり\n今日で最後みたいな挨拶になっちまったな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-36:text",
        "step_id": 36,
        "step_index": 35,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 35
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ここまで俺たちを導いてくれた感謝を、\n改めて伝えておきたくてさ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-37:text",
        "step_id": 37,
        "step_index": 36,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 36
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺をスカウトしてくれたこと。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-39:text",
        "step_id": 39,
        "step_index": 38,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 38
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "315プロダクションで、\n最高の仲間たちと引き合わせてくれたこと。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-41:text",
        "step_id": 41,
        "step_index": 40,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 40
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そしてJIFという大きな舞台に\n立たせてくれたこと……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-43:text",
        "step_id": 43,
        "step_index": 42,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 42
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あんたは俺たちの努力の成果だって言うけど、\nそれだけじゃない。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-45:text",
        "step_id": 45,
        "step_index": 44,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 44
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●プロデューサーが俺たちを支えて、\n一緒に努力してくれたから、ここにいるんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-46:text",
        "step_id": 46,
        "step_index": 45,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 45
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺たちを見つけたあんたの目に狂いはなかったって、\n証明してくる！　だから、見ててくれ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-47:text",
        "step_id": 47,
        "step_index": 46,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 46
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あんたがスカウトした、\n俺たちアイドル全員の姿をさ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-48:text",
        "step_id": 48,
        "step_index": 47,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 47
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おい、天道。何をしている。置いていくぞ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "桜庭 薫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_e:step-51:text",
        "step_id": 51,
        "step_index": 50,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_e",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_e.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 54,
          "target_step_index": 50
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "分かった！　すぐ行く！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天道 輝"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
